I readily admit that the translation so far is very far
from perfect, but doing it is fun and also instructive.
We are always in time to improve it as we gain a better
command of the language. With that example I just wanted
to show that doing puns in Lojban is not all that hard
(then again, doing good puns is harder, of course).

Here's my first stab at the Lobster Quadrille song,
to show that rhymes are also quite possible. (As always,
I welcome suggestions for improvements):

